[[Image:Anvilmar.jpg|thumb|300px|Anvilmar]]
'''Anvilmar''' (also known as '''building A3''')<ref>[[Simple Memorandum]]</ref> is the first settlement of significance encountered by [[Dwarf (playable)|starting dwarves]] and [[Gnome (playable)|gnomes]]. It lies to the north in [[Coldridge Valley]] and has a set of [[trainer]]s and some [[quest giver]]s, as well as a few [[vendor]]s. The central structure of Anvilmar houses a large forge, although there are no tradeskill trainers present.

