* In the early beta, the area was known as '''Anvil Marr''' instead.<ref>[https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/The_World_of_Warcraft_Townhall/Races_of_Azeroth#Dwarves The World of Warcraft Townhall/Races of Azeroth#Dwarves]</ref>

