'''Angor Fortress''' is the main site of operations of the [[Dark Iron clan|Dark Iron dwarves]] in the [[Badlands]]. Here, they organize their exploration for exploiting [[Uldaman]]. An agent of [[Ragnaros]], [[Ambassador Infernus]], also resides in this [[keep]].

